  "question": {
    "text": "The probability that at least one of $A$ and $B$ occurs is 0.6 . If A and $B$ occur simultaneously with probability 0.3 , then $P^{\\prime}\\left(A^{\\prime}\\right)+P_{(}\\left(B^{\\prime}\\right)$ is",
